## User settings & state
xcuserdata/
*.xcuserdatad
*.xcscmblueprint
*.xcuserstate
*.xcuserdatad/
*.xcuserdatad

## Build products & derived data
DerivedData/
build/
*.build
*.ipa
*.dSYM.zip
*.dSYM

## Swift Package Manager
.build/
Packages/
Package.pins
Package.resolved
.swiftpm/xcode/package.resolved
.swiftpm/

## CocoaPods (if used)
Pods/
Podfile.lock

## Carthage (if used)
Carthage/Build/

## Fastlane
fastlane/report.xml
fastlane/Preview.html
fastlane/screenshots
fastlane/test_output

# macOS System Files
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes

# Sensitive Configurations & Secrets
*.env
*.env.local
*.secret
*.keystore
*.cer
*.p12
*.mobileprovision
Config.xcconfig
Secrets.swift
Secrets.plist

# Backup & Temp Files
*.swp
*.bak
*~
*.orig
